// Identity evidence classes beyond the presence cookie and the crawler signature.
//   delegation  a proven principal (human) mints a token binding its session transcript to an agent host and a purpose;
//               an agent presents it beside its own RFC 9421 signature -> bucket "delegated"; authority only narrows
//   workload    machine identity for APIs: Cloudflare mTLS (cf.tlsClientAuth) or a SPIFFE JWT-SVID (EdDSA) verified
//               against a configured JWKS -> identity "workload:<id>", counted with proven agents, method labeled
//   app         native-app attestation hook: today an HMAC app token minted at /__app/token for a registered app;
//               production verifiers (Apple App Attest assertion, Google Play Integrity verdict) plug in here
